  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023Beyond &amp; Constructive Institute - New Narratives for Africa, 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project promotes nuanced narratives about Africa, by fostering collaboration between Danish and African media professionals, it will support the exchange and innovation of journalistic practices and thereby high quality journalism in African countries. The project contributes to creating equal partnerships with African Countries which can serve as a foundation for professional media training.</narrative>
